Rationale: initialize the host profiling test stand-in for late admission, and cover draft-zero row layouts, late-admission hooks and encoder-bound cache identity together with steering. Quality: tests only; projection arithmetic, weights and runtime policy are unchanged. CPU host contracts do not qualify GPU replay, sink thresholds or KV rollback.

